Package: wet
Title: Stream Flow and Water Temperature for the BC Freshwater Atlas
Version: 0.4.19
Date: 2026-10-24
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Mean monthly and annual stream flow for the British Columbia
    Freshwater Atlas (FWA), published openly per stream segment from two
    sources: the Pacific Climate Impacts Consortium's (PCIC) routed
    hydrologic model, and an open water balance fitted at Water Survey of
    Canada (HYDAT) gauges. Daily flow and water temperature at hydrometric
    stations are summarised per year over month-day windows, so each year
    can be compared with normal. Under active development.
